From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:36:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] include: list wine/madeira_fastsync.h so makedep can resolve
 it

dlls/ntdll/unix/sync.c includes "wine/madeira_fastsync.h" (fastsync, #16),
but makedep only resolves wine/ headers that include/Makefile.in lists, so
regenerating the Makefiles stopped every PE build with "wine/madeira_fastsync.h:
No such file or directory". The iOS unix-side build scripts compile with their
own include paths and were not affected.

Playport (decision 0054): carried in patches/wine-unix with the fastsync
client (0016), since the unix tree is configured, and its Makefiles made by
makedep, from this tree. Taken from the madeira-main reference branch's
re-port (its wine-port 0078).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Madeira-commit: f674487eb601ea09abb81b5c3b5d2411f2dc8e35
Class: feature
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-06-fastsync-on-8c050d0.md, madeira-main:docs/evidence/2026-10-06-portal2-madeira-wow64.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 include/Makefile.in | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/Makefile.in b/include/Makefile.in
index 49cfc06..5ddebf3 100644
--- a/include/Makefile.in
+++ b/include/Makefile.in
@@ -1133,6 +1133,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	wine/itss.idl \
 	wine/list.h \
 	wine/lsass.idl \
+	wine/madeira_fastsync.h \
 	wine/mfinternal.idl \
 	wine/mmsystem16.h \
 	wine/mscvpdb.h \
